{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Pointwise Convergence","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>逐点收敛 · Pointwise Convergence</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n,f:E\\to\\mathbb R</span>。若对每个固定的 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in E</span>，都有数列的<a href=\"#/learn/calc.limit?anchor=definition\">极限</a></p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}f_n(x)=f(x),\n</div>\n<p>就称函数列 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">E</span> 上**逐点收敛（converges pointwise）**到 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span>。</p>\n<p>等价地，对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in E</span>、每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</span>，存在 <span class=\"math inline\">N=N(x,\\varepsilon)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math inline\">n\\ge N</span> 时 <span class=\"math inline\">|f_n(x)-f(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon</span>。这里所需的 <span class=\"math inline\">N</span> 可以随 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 改变。</p>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n(x)=x^n</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">[0,1]</span> 上逐点收敛到 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)=0</span>（<span class=\"math inline\">x&lt;1</span>）和 <span class=\"math inline\">f(1)=1</span>。逐点收敛本身不能保证积分收敛；<a href=\"#/learn/ra.dominated-convergence?anchor=definition\">控制收敛定理</a>提供了附加条件。</p>\n<p>具体证明实例见<a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=laplace-proof\">斯特林讲义中的函数极限</a>。</p>\n","id":"ra.pointwise-convergence.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"ra.pointwise-convergence","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"逐点收敛"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Pointwise Convergence","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>逐点收敛 · Pointwise Convergence</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n,f:E\\to\\mathbb R</span>。若对每个固定的 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in E</span>，都有数列的<a href=\"#/learn/calc.limit?anchor=definition\">极限</a></p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}f_n(x)=f(x),\n</div>\n<p>就称函数列 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">E</span> 上**逐点收敛（converges pointwise）**到 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span>。</p>\n<p>等价地，对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in E</span>、每个 <span class=\"math inline\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</span>，存在 <span class=\"math inline\">N=N(x,\\varepsilon)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math inline\">n\\ge N</span> 时 <span class=\"math inline\">|f_n(x)-f(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon</span>。这里所需的 <span class=\"math inline\">N</span> 可以随 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 改变。</p>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n(x)=x^n</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">[0,1]</span> 上逐点收敛到 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)=0</span>（<span class=\"math inline\">x&lt;1</span>）和 <span class=\"math inline\">f(1)=1</span>。逐点收敛本身不能保证积分收敛；<a href=\"#/learn/ra.dominated-convergence?anchor=definition\">控制收敛定理</a>提供了附加条件。</p>\n<p>具体证明实例见<a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=laplace-proof\">斯特林讲义中的函数极限</a>。</p>\n","id":"ra.pointwise-convergence.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"ra.pointwise-convergence","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"逐点收敛"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"english_title":"Pointwise Convergence","id":"ra.pointwise-convergence.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"ra.pointwise-convergence","title":"逐点收敛"}],"bibliography":[],"contains":[],"content_status":"definition","default_articles":["ra.pointwise-convergence.main"],"english_title":"Pointwise Convergence","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>逐点收敛 · Pointwise Convergence</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n,f:E\\to\\mathbb R</span>。若对每个固定的 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in E</span>，都有数列的<a href=\"#/learn/calc.limit?anchor=definition\">极限</a></p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}f_n(x)=f(x),\n</div>\n<p>就称函数列 <span class=\"math inline\">f_n</span> 在 <span class=\"math inl